{"version":1,"id":"matematicas-2009-reserva-5","asignatura":"matematicas","anio":2009,"convocatoria":"Reserva 5","documento":"MAT-2009-RESERVA_5.pdf","ejercicios":[{"id":"matematicas-2009-reserva-5-1","n":1,"num":1,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Se sabe que la función \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) definida como \\[f(x)=\\begin{cases}-x^2+bx+1&\\text{si }x\\leq1\\\\ax^2-5x+2a&\\text{si }x\\gt1\\end{cases}\\] es derivable. Determina los valores de \\(a\\) y \\(b\\).","apartados":[]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Resolución","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Cada trozo es un polinomio. Al ser derivable, \\(f\\) es continua y tiene derivadas laterales iguales en \\(x=1\\).</p><p><b>Continuidad:</b> \\(\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to1^-}f(x)=-1+b+1=b=f(1)\\) y \\(\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to1^+}f(x)=a-5+2a=3a-5\\). Por tanto \\(b=3a-5\\).</p>\\[f'(x)=\\begin{cases}-2x+b&x\\lt1\\\\2ax-5&x\\gt1\\end{cases}\\qquad f'(1^-)=b-2,\\quad f'(1^+)=2a-5\\ \\Rightarrow\\ b=2a-3\\]<p>Igualando: \\(3a-5=2a-3\\iff a=2\\), y \\(b=1\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(a=2\\), \\(b=1\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"funciones","tipo":"cont","apartados":""}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2009-RESERVA_5.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2009-reserva-5-2","n":2,"num":2,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"","apartados":["(1,25 p.) Calcula \\(\\displaystyle\\int x\\,\\mathrm{sen}\\,x\\,dx\\).","(1,25 p.) Sean las funciones \\(f,g:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\), definidas por \\(f(x)=-x^2+1\\), \\(g(x)=x-1\\). Calcula el área del recinto limitado por sus gráficas."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Por partes<i class='n' data-t='th'>Integración por partes: \\(\\int u\\,dv=uv-\\int v\\,du\\).</i> con \\(u=x\\), \\(dv=\\mathrm{sen}\\,x\\,dx\\) (\\(du=dx\\), \\(v=-\\cos x\\)):</p>\\[\\int x\\,\\mathrm{sen}\\,x\\,dx=-x\\cos x+\\int\\cos x\\,dx=-x\\cos x+\\mathrm{sen}\\,x+C\\]<div class='res'>\\(\\displaystyle\\int x\\,\\mathrm{sen}\\,x\\,dx=-x\\cos x+\\mathrm{sen}\\,x+C\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'>\\[-x^2+1=x-1\\iff x^2+x-2=0\\iff x=-2\\ \\text{ o }\\ x=1\\]<div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 220' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='63.3,167.9 67.4,158.4 71.5,149.3 75.5,140.6 79.6,132.2 83.6,124.2 87.7,116.5 91.8,109.2 95.8,102.3 99.9,95.7 104.0,89.5 108.0,83.7 112.1,78.2 116.1,73.1 120.2,68.3 124.3,63.9 128.3,59.9 132.4,56.2 136.5,52.9 140.5,49.9 144.6,47.3 148.6,45.1 152.7,43.2 156.8,41.7 160.8,40.6 164.9,39.8 169.0,39.4 173.0,39.3 177.1,39.6 181.1,40.3 185.2,41.3 189.3,42.7 193.3,44.4 197.4,46.5 201.5,49.0 205.5,51.8 209.6,55.0 213.6,58.6 217.7,62.5 221.8,66.8 225.8,71.4 225.8,71.4 221.8,73.8 217.7,76.2 213.6,78.7 209.6,81.1 205.5,83.5 201.5,85.9 197.4,88.3 193.3,90.7 189.3,93.1 185.2,95.5 181.1,97.9 177.1,100.4 173.0,102.8 169.0,105.2 164.9,107.6 160.8,110.0 156.8,112.4 152.7,114.8 148.6,117.2 144.6,119.6 140.5,122.1 136.5,124.5 132.4,126.9 128.3,129.3 124.3,131.7 120.2,134.1 116.1,136.5 112.1,138.9 108.0,141.3 104.0,143.8 99.9,146.2 95.8,148.6 91.8,151.0 87.7,153.4 83.6,155.8 79.6,158.2 75.5,160.6 71.5,163.0 67.4,165.4 63.3,167.9' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='41.7,224.4 45.5,213.8 49.2,203.5 53.0,193.4 56.8,183.7 60.6,174.4 64.4,165.3 68.2,156.5 72.0,148.1 75.8,140.0 79.6,132.2 83.4,124.7 87.2,117.5 91.0,110.6 94.8,104.1 98.5,97.9 102.3,91.9 106.1,86.3 109.9,81.1 113.7,76.1 117.5,71.4 121.3,67.1 125.1,63.1 128.9,59.3 132.7,55.9 136.5,52.9 140.2,50.1 144.0,47.6 147.8,45.5 151.6,43.7 155.4,42.2 159.2,41.0 163.0,40.1 166.8,39.5 170.6,39.3 174.4,39.4 178.2,39.7 182.0,40.4 185.8,41.5 189.5,42.8 193.3,44.4 197.1,46.4 200.9,48.7 204.7,51.2 208.5,54.1 212.3,57.4 216.1,60.9 219.9,64.7 223.7,68.9 227.5,73.4 231.2,78.2 235.0,83.3 238.8,88.7 242.6,94.4 246.4,100.5 250.2,106.9 254.0,113.5 257.8,120.5 261.6,127.9 265.4,135.5 269.2,143.4' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='20.0,193.6 150.0,116.4 280.0,39.3' fill='none' stroke='#f0a30a' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='63.3' cy='167.9' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='17.3' y='165.9'>(−2,−3)</text><circle cx='225.8' cy='71.4' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='231.8' y='63.4'>(1,0)</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 71.4H294.0M171.7 214.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='63.3' y1='68.4' x2='63.3' y2='74.4' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='60.3' y='85.4' font-size='10'>-2</text><line x1='117.5' y1='68.4' x2='117.5' y2='74.4' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='114.5' y='85.4' font-size='10'>-1</text><line x1='225.8' y1='68.4' x2='225.8' y2='74.4' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='222.8' y='85.4' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='168.7' y1='167.9' x2='174.7' y2='167.9' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='155.7' y='171.9' font-size='10'>-3</text><line x1='168.7' y1='103.6' x2='174.7' y2='103.6' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='155.7' y='107.6' font-size='10'>-1</text><line x1='168.7' y1='39.3' x2='174.7' y2='39.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='155.7' y='43.3' font-size='10'>1</text></svg></div><p>Entre \\(-2\\) y \\(1\\) la parábola queda por encima (en \\(x=0\\): \\(1\\gt-1\\)):</p>\\[A=\\int_{-2}^1(-x^2-x+2)\\,dx=\\Bigl[-\\frac{x^3}3-\\frac{x^2}2+2x\\Bigr]_{-2}^1=\\frac76-\\left(-\\frac{10}3\\right)=\\frac92\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=\\dfrac92\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"integ","tipo":"part","apartados":"a"},{"tema":"integ","tipo":"area","apartados":"b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2009-RESERVA_5.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2009-reserva-5-3","n":3,"num":3,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"","apartados":["(1,25 p.) Resuelve el sistema de ecuaciones \\[\\begin{cases}x+z=2\\\\-x+y+2z=0\\\\-x+2y+5z=2\\end{cases}\\]","(1,25 p.) Calcula \\(\\lambda\\) sabiendo que el siguiente sistema tiene alguna solución común con el del apartado (a) \\[\\begin{cases}x+y+z=1\\\\-x+y+3z=1\\\\x+2y+\\lambda z=-3\\end{cases}\\]"]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'>\\[A^*=\\left(\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1&0&1&2\\\\-1&1&2&0\\\\-1&2&5&2\\end{array}\\right)\\]<p>Por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}1&0&1\\\\-1&1&2\\\\-1&2&5\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(5+0-2\\bigr)-\\bigl(-1+4+0\\bigr)\\]\\[=0\\]<p>\\(\\begin{vmatrix}1&0\\\\-1&1\\end{vmatrix}=1\\neq0\\): \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=2\\). Menor de \\(A^*\\) de las columnas 1, 2 y 4:</p>\\[\\begin{vmatrix}1&0&2\\\\-1&1&0\\\\-1&2&2\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(2+0-4\\bigr)-\\bigl(-2+0+0\\bigr)\\]\\[=0\\]<p>\\(\\operatorname{rg}A=\\operatorname{rg}A^*=2\\): compatible indeterminado<i class='n' data-t='th'>Rouché-Frobenius: el sistema es compatible si y solo si \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=\\operatorname{rg}A^*\\); determinado si ese rango es el número de incógnitas, indeterminado si es menor.</i>. </p><p>Doy a la incógnita \\(z\\) el valor \\(z=t\\) y lo paso al segundo miembro<i class='n' data-t='why'>La incógnita que no está en el menor no nulo pasa al segundo miembro como parámetro; así queda un sistema con tantas ecuaciones como incógnitas y determinante distinto de 0, que se resuelve por Cramer.</i>:</p>\\[\\begin{cases}x=2 - t\\\\-x+y=- 2 t\\end{cases}\\]<p>Lo resuelvo por la regla de Cramer<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Cramer: si \\(|A|\\neq0\\), cada incógnita es el cociente entre el determinante que resulta de sustituir su columna por la de los términos independientes y el determinante \\(|A|\\) de la matriz de coeficientes.</i>:</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}1&0\\\\-1&1\\end{vmatrix}=1\\]\\[x=\\frac{\\begin{vmatrix}2 - t&0\\\\- 2 t&1\\end{vmatrix}}{1}=2 - t\\]\\[y=\\frac{\\begin{vmatrix}1&2 - t\\\\-1&- 2 t\\end{vmatrix}}{1}=2 - 3 t\\]<div class='res'>\\(x=2-t,\\ y=2-3t,\\ z=t\\), con \\(t\\in\\mathbb R\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Una solución común es una solución \\((2-t,\\,2-3t,\\,t)\\) del primero que cumple el segundo:</p>\\[\\begin{cases}(2-t)+(2-3t)+t=1\\\\-(2-t)+(2-3t)+3t=1\\\\(2-t)+2(2-3t)+\\lambda t=-3\\end{cases}\\iff\\begin{cases}4-3t=1\\\\t=1\\\\6-7t+\\lambda t=-3\\end{cases}\\]<p>Las dos primeras dan \\(t=1\\) (compatibles entre sí). En la tercera: \\(6-7+\\lambda=-3\\iff\\lambda=-2\\). La solución común es \\((1,-1,1)\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(\\lambda=-2\\) (solución común \\(x=1,\\ y=-1,\\ z=1\\))</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"sistemas","tipo":"disc","apartados":"a"},{"tema":"sistemas","tipo":"res","apartados":"a, b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2009-RESERVA_5.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2009-reserva-5-4","n":4,"num":4,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Halla la ecuación de la recta que pasa por el punto \\(A(1,1,-1)\\), es paralela al plano de ecuación \\(x-y+z=1\\) y corta al eje \\(Z\\).","apartados":[]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Resolución","html":"<div class='ex'><p>El punto de corte con el eje \\(Z\\) es de la forma \\(C(0,0,c)\\). La recta tiene director \\(\\overrightarrow{AC}=(-1,-1,c+1)\\). Es paralela al plano si su director es perpendicular a la normal \\(\\vec n=(1,-1,1)\\):</p>\\[\\overrightarrow{AC}\\cdot\\vec n=-1+1+c+1=0\\iff c=-1\\]<p>\\(C(0,0,-1)\\) y \\(\\overrightarrow{AC}=(-1,-1,0)\\parallel(1,1,0)\\).</p><div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":-39,\"el\":18,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[1.679,2.169,1.49],[-1.169,-0.679,1.49],[-0.179,-1.669,-0.49],[2.669,1.179,-0.49]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[-0.179,-1.669,-0.49],\"π\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"line\",[0,0,-2],[0,0,2],\"#94a3b8\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[0,0,2],\"Z\",\"#94a3b8\",6,0],[\"line\",[-0.6,-0.6,-1.0],[1.6,1.6,-1.0],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[1.6,1.6,-1.0],\"s\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"pt\",[1,1,-1],\"A\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[0,0,-1],\"C\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m09r5a4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m09r5a4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m09r5a4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m09r5a4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='274.9,46.0 34.8,38.2 26.0,176.8 266.1,184.6' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='30.0' y='176.8' fill='#7c3aed' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>π</text><line x1='110.5' y1='246.0' x2='110.5' y2='18.0' stroke='#94a3b8' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='116.5' y='18.0' fill='#94a3b8' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>Z</text><line x1='59.9' y1='187.4' x2='245.4' y2='193.4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='251.4' y='193.4' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>s</text><circle cx='194.8' cy='191.7' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='201.8' y='185.7' font-weight='700'>A</text><circle cx='110.5' cy='189.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='117.5' y='183.0' font-weight='700'>C</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='34.1' y2='273.8' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='34.6' y='279.2' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='36.4' y2='266.9' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='37.8' y='269.8' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='254.8' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='253.5' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>recta</text></g><g transform='translate(157.0,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>\\(\\begin{cases}x=1+t\\\\y=1+t\\\\z=-1\\end{cases}\\), \\(t\\in\\mathbb R\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"geom","tipo":"ecs","apartados":""},{"tema":"geom","tipo":"pos","apartados":""}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2009-RESERVA_5.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2009-reserva-5-5","n":5,"num":1,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Se sabe que la función \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) definida por \\(f(x)=ax^3+bx^2+cx+d\\) tiene extremos relativos en \\((0,0)\\) y en \\((2,2)\\). Calcula \\(a\\), \\(b\\), \\(c\\) y \\(d\\).","apartados":[]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Resolución","html":"<div class='ex'><p>\\(f\\) es derivable: en un extremo relativo \\(f'=0\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Si una función derivable tiene un extremo relativo en \\(x_0\\), entonces \\(f'(x_0)=0\\).</i>. Con \\(f'(x)=3ax^2+2bx+c\\):</p>\\[\\begin{cases}f(0)=0\\\\f'(0)=0\\\\f(2)=2\\\\f'(2)=0\\end{cases}\\iff\\begin{cases}d=0\\\\c=0\\\\8a+4b=2\\\\12a+4b=0\\end{cases}\\]<p>Restando las dos últimas: \\(4a=-2\\iff a=-\\frac12\\), y \\(4b=-12a=6\\iff b=\\frac32\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(a=-\\dfrac12,\\ b=\\dfrac32,\\ c=0,\\ d=0\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>\\(f(x)=-\\frac12x^3+\\frac32x^2\\), \\(f'(x)=-\\frac32x(x-2)\\): pasa de negativa a positiva en 0 (mínimo) y de positiva a negativa en 2 (máximo) ✓.</i></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"funciones","tipo":"mono","apartados":""}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2009-RESERVA_5.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2009-reserva-5-6","n":6,"num":2,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Las dos gráficas del dibujo corresponden a la función \\(f:(0,+\\infty)\\to\\mathbb R\\) definida por \\(f(x)=\\dfrac2x+2\\ln(x)\\) y a la de su derivada \\(f':(0,+\\infty)\\to\\mathbb R\\) (\\(\\ln\\) denota logaritmo neperiano).<div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 260 190' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='80.9,92.6 83.2,92.5 85.5,92.4 87.9,92.1 90.2,91.8 92.6,91.5 94.9,91.1 97.2,90.6 99.6,90.1 101.9,89.6 104.3,89.1 106.6,88.5 108.9,88.0 111.3,87.4 113.6,86.8 116.0,86.2 118.3,85.6 120.6,85.0 123.0,84.4 125.3,83.8 127.7,83.2 130.0,82.6 132.3,82.0 134.7,81.4 137.0,80.8 139.4,80.2 141.7,79.6 144.0,79.0 146.4,78.4 148.7,77.9 151.1,77.3 153.4,76.7 155.7,76.1 158.1,75.6 160.4,75.0 162.8,74.4 165.1,73.9 167.4,73.3 169.8,72.8 172.1,72.2 174.5,71.7 174.5,130.2 172.1,130.1 169.8,130.0 167.4,129.9 165.1,129.9 162.8,129.8 160.4,129.7 158.1,129.6 155.7,129.5 153.4,129.4 151.1,129.4 148.7,129.3 146.4,129.2 144.0,129.1 141.7,129.1 139.4,129.0 137.0,129.0 134.7,128.9 132.3,128.9 130.0,128.9 127.7,128.9 125.3,128.9 123.0,128.9 120.6,129.0 118.3,129.0 116.0,129.1 113.6,129.2 111.3,129.4 108.9,129.6 106.6,129.9 104.3,130.2 101.9,130.6 99.6,131.1 97.2,131.7 94.9,132.4 92.6,133.2 90.2,134.2 87.9,135.5 85.5,137.0 83.2,138.8 80.9,141.0' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='53.7,67.7 56.0,74.4 58.2,79.3 60.5,83.0 62.8,85.8 65.1,87.9 67.3,89.4 69.6,90.6 71.9,91.4 74.1,92.0 76.4,92.3 78.7,92.5 80.9,92.6 83.2,92.5 85.5,92.4 87.8,92.1 90.0,91.8 92.3,91.5 94.6,91.1 96.8,90.7 99.1,90.2 101.4,89.7 103.6,89.2 105.9,88.7 108.2,88.2 110.5,87.6 112.7,87.1 115.0,86.5 117.3,85.9 119.5,85.3 121.8,84.7 124.1,84.2 126.3,83.6 128.6,83.0 130.9,82.4 133.2,81.8 135.4,81.2 137.7,80.6 140.0,80.1 142.2,79.5 144.5,78.9 14