rtados":["(0,5 p.) Indica, razonando la respuesta, cuál es la gráfica de \\(f\\) y cuál la de \\(f'\\).","(2 p.) Calcula el área de la región sombreada."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'>\\[f'(x)=-\\frac2{x^2}+\\frac2x=\\frac{2(x-1)}{x^2}\\]<p>\\(f'(1)=0\\) y \\(f'\\) cambia de negativa a positiva en \\(x=1\\): \\(f'\\) corta al eje en \\(x=1\\) y \\(f\\) tiene en \\(x=1\\) un mínimo (\\(f(1)=2\\gt0\\)). La gráfica (b) corta al eje en \\(x=1\\) y la (a) tiene un mínimo ahí. Además \\(f'(x)\\to0\\) cuando \\(x\\to+\\infty\\), como (b), mientras que \\(f\\to+\\infty\\), como (a).</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 220' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='91.9,107.1 94.7,107.0 97.4,106.8 100.2,106.6 103.0,106.2 105.7,105.8 108.5,105.3 111.3,104.7 114.0,104.1 116.8,103.5 119.6,102.9 122.3,102.3 125.1,101.6 127.9,100.9 130.6,100.2 133.4,99.5 136.2,98.8 138.9,98.1 141.7,97.3 144.5,96.6 147.2,95.9 150.0,95.2 152.8,94.4 155.5,93.7 158.3,93.0 161.1,92.3 163.8,91.6 166.6,90.8 169.4,90.1 172.1,89.4 174.9,88.7 177.7,88.0 180.4,87.3 183.2,86.7 186.0,86.0 188.7,85.3 191.5,84.6 194.3,84.0 197.0,83.3 199.8,82.7 202.6,82.0 202.6,152.3 199.8,152.2 197.0,152.0 194.3,151.9 191.5,151.8 188.7,151.7 186.0,151.6 183.2,151.5 180.4,151.4 177.7,151.3 174.9,151.2 172.1,151.1 169.4,151.0 166.6,151.0 163.8,150.9 161.1,150.8 158.3,150.8 155.5,150.7 152.8,150.7 150.0,150.7 147.2,150.6 144.5,150.7 141.7,150.7 138.9,150.7 136.2,150.8 133.4,150.9 130.6,151.1 127.9,151.3 125.1,151.6 122.3,151.9 119.6,152.3 116.8,152.7 114.0,153.3 111.3,154.0 108.5,154.9 105.7,155.9 103.0,157.1 100.2,158.6 97.4,160.4 94.7,162.5 91.9,165.2' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='59.8,77.3 62.5,85.2 65.2,91.2 67.9,95.6 70.6,98.9 73.2,101.4 75.9,103.3 78.6,104.7 81.3,105.7 84.0,106.4 86.7,106.8 89.3,107.0 92.0,107.1 94.7,107.0 97.4,106.8 100.1,106.6 102.8,106.2 105.4,105.8 10